Foundation map
Level	Holds	MTSV	Source
file	a JSON Lines file of TracesData or LogsData; a MetricsData line holds none of the 8 and yields no rows; invalid UTF-8 read as U+FFFD	one MTSV file	OTEL-FILE-EXPORTER; OTLP docs/specification › UTF-8 String Handling
envelope	resourceSpans[] and resourceLogs[], each with its schemaUrl	Z: a sheet; Y: a row each	OTLP opentelemetry/proto/trace/v1/trace.proto; logs/v1/logs.proto
resource	a Resource: its attributes, dropped count, entity references	Z: a child sheet, one row	OTLP opentelemetry/proto/resource/v1/resource.proto; common/v1/common.proto
scope	scopeSpans[] and scopeLogs[], each with its scope: name, version, attributes	Z: child sheets	OTLP opentelemetry/proto/common/v1/common.proto
record	a Span or a LogRecord: ids, times, name, kind, flags, severity, event name, dropped counts	Z: a sheet; Y: a row per record; X: its simple fields	OTLP opentelemetry/proto/trace/v1/trace.proto; logs/v1/logs.proto
status, event, link	a Span's status, events[] and links[]	Z: child sheets	OTLP opentelemetry/proto/trace/v1/trace.proto
attributes	the KeyValue list of a resource, scope, span, event, link or log record: unordered, identified by key	Z: a sheet per owner; X: key; the value by the node rules	OTEL-COMMON › Attribute Collections; AnyValue representation for non-OTLP protocols
body	a LogRecord's body, an AnyValue	Z: a node sheet	OTLP opentelemetry/proto/logs/v1/logs.proto; OTEL-COMMON
the 8	attributes of a span or log record whose key is one of the 8	their schemas' sheets, as now; never also in an attributes sheet	OTEL-GENAI
item, field, nested, node, text, line, character	as now	as now	the current Pattern
encoding	ids as hex text; enums as integers; 64-bit numbers and times as decimal strings; unknown fields ignored; profiling-only fields absent	written as the input holds them	OTLP docs/specification › JSON Protobuf Encoding; common.proto
